    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d132">

                <pb facs="0417" n="369" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg369"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Johnson to Mr. Seward. </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 48.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1868-11-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 10, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> * * * * * *</p>
                <p>The amendment you suggested in the San Juan protocol has been made by a
                    supplementary protocol, the original of which accompanies this dispatch. I am
                    glad to say that Lord Stanley willingly and at once assented to your
                    suggestion.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain, with high regard, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>REVERDY JOHNSON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d132-a1.xml" xpointer="d132-a1"/>
            </div>
